; The variable: a CPUParticles3D PointMesh whose emission texture projects by world triplanar. Each
; particle is an instance, so its point reads its own MODEL_MATRIX (`scene_forward_clustered.glsl:338-346`)
; and takes one colour from the gradient at its place, turned by its own rotate_y angle. Albedo
; reads POINT_COORD instead (`material.cpp:1612-1615`), so the albedo is black. No other golden shows it.
